  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.6,
      "end_seconds": 2.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 2.65,
      "end_seconds": 6.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.06,
      "end_seconds": 15.2,
      "duration_seconds": 8.14,
      "text": "I wanted to get a pink spotty rash looked at sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.07,
      "end_seconds": 19.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.32,
      "end_seconds": 28.69,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "I've had it since Friday. I did try to ignore it for a while"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.4,
      "end_seconds": 32.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.56,
      "end_seconds": 52.61,
      "duration_seconds": 18.05,
      "text": "A mild temperature goes along with it, most of the time. Mm, I've had a runny nose too, for three weeks. Yeah, the mild temperature? That's been for two months. With mild temperature, about a three out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.57,
      "end_seconds": 74.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "A few quick ones: stiff neck, drowsiness or breathlessness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.3,
      "end_seconds": 81.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "I haven't had stiff neck, drowsiness or breathlessness, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.95,
      "end_seconds": 84.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.71,
      "end_seconds": 86.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "breathing's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.91,
      "end_seconds": 90.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.35,
      "end_seconds": 104.12,
      "duration_seconds": 9.77,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning. My partner and our baby. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.49,
      "end_seconds": 107.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.79,
      "end_seconds": 121.22,
      "duration_seconds": 12.43,
      "text": "I mean, I take Seretide inhaler, twice a day for my asthma. Paracetamol syrup. I take it it 5 ml, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.39,
      "end_seconds": 125.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Since when have you been taking it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.89,
      "end_seconds": 128.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "About about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.84,
      "end_seconds": 132.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.8,
      "end_seconds": 139.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "Yes, I had a caesarean for my second baby, nine years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.38,
      "end_seconds": 142.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.82,
      "end_seconds": 146.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "I've got asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.39,
      "end_seconds": 152.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.9,
      "end_seconds": 157.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.37,
      "end_seconds": 161.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "time for your numbers, if that's okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.67,
      "end_seconds": 174.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.45,
      "end_seconds": 204.71,
      "duration_seconds": 11.26,
      "text": "Okay: BMI works out to 26.7, saturation 98 percent, weight 70 kilos. And temperature 36.6, pressure 127 over 81, pulse 85, height 162 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.96,
      "end_seconds": 210.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.0,
      "end_seconds": 213.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "look straight ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.35,
      "end_seconds": 230.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "the spots fade when pressed and he is playful and drinking well"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.9,
      "end_seconds": 235.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.73,
      "end_seconds": 252.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.77,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? This is probably a harmless viral rash. I'd also keep an allergic rash in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.21,
      "end_seconds": 255.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.38,
      "end_seconds": 263.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.95,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a harmless viral rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.17,
      "end_seconds": 286.77,
      "duration_seconds": 12.6,
      "text": "Fluids and paracetamol if he is hot or uncomfortable. One warning sign to remember: the spots do not fade when pressed or he becomes drowsy. In that case don't wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.85,
      "end_seconds": 290.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.34,
      "end_seconds": 299.7,
      "duration_seconds": 8.36,
      "text": "come back if it lasts more than a week right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.5,
      "end_seconds": 304.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.07,
      "end_seconds": 307.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "So, all the best."
    }
  ]
}